<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 26.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 26.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 26	Feb 25     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  261.300     261.840     247.020    5.78 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.100     303.520     306.830   -1.22 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.200     156.290     158.970   -1.74 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.280	46.330	47.182   -1.91 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  428.160     428.800     419.180    2.14 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.920     139.030     141.685   -1.95 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.681	15.713	16.185   -3.11 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.700     214.650     212.430    1.54 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.842	 1.846	 1.888   -2.44 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.556	 1.557	 1.581   -1.58 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  178.630     179.330     183.135   -2.46 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
